==English==

===Etymology===
From {{der|en|hi|सोला टोपी}}, from {{der|en|hi|सोला||the plant ''Aeschynomene aspera''}} + {{der|en|hi|टोपी||hat}}. The spelling {{m|en|solar}} is a [[Hobson-Jobsonism]] from English {{m|en|solar||relating to the sun}}, as the hat provided shade from the sun.

